DESCRIPTION:Join us on May 1st for MSU's Mental Health Awareness Month Fla
 g Raising hosted by CAPS. Let's come together as a community to recognize
  the importance of mental health\, reduce stigma\, and reaffirm our commi
 tment to care\, compassion\, and connection. The flag raising will be fol
 lowed by a self-care\, resource table hosted by CAPS and the Office of He
 alth Promotion.\n\nHosted by: CAPS (Counseling and Psychological Services
 )\, Office of Health Promotion\n\nAdditional Information can be found at:
  https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12415615
